    "description": "Natural Mineral Specimen Set\nAmethyst and Smoky Quartz (Morion)\nTotal Weight: 2 lbs\nThis natural mineral specimen set features two distinct geological formations: a vibrant Amethyst crystal cluster and a large, dark Smoky Quartz (Morion) terminated point. The Amethyst displays a dense druzy formation with rich violet tones, while the Smoky Quartz specimen showcases a primary prismatic termination accented by secondary crystal growths at the base. These earth-mined specimens are ideal for geological study, mineral collections, or decorative display.\nNatural Amethyst cluster with multiple faceted crystal terminations\nDark Smoky Quartz (Morion) point with distinct prismatic habit\nRaw geological matrix preserved on the underside of specimens\nTotal set dimensions approximately 5 x 5 x 3 inches\nCondition:\nGood pre-owned condition. Natural mineral specimens with inherent geological characteristics. The Amethyst crystals are intact with consistent coloration. The Smoky Quartz point shows sharp edges and natural surface textures; any internal veining or minor surface irregularities are consistent with raw earth-mined stones. No significant post-extraction damage observed.\nTHANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING OUR MISSION!\nIf there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days.\nOur business hours are Monday - Friday  7:00 am to 3:00 pm EST\n**If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so.\n**Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nGoodwill of Western and Northern Connecticut strengthens communities by helping people with disabilities and other disadvantages maximize independence through job training and other support services.",
